        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "In its belly burns a fire, which Vulpix spits out in the form of\nfireballs. When young, this Pokémon has but one white tail.\nAs the Pokémon matures, this single tail splits into six.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
